{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52522","headline":"南獠纳欵 · 陈元光","name":"南獠纳欵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南薰阜物华，南獠俨庭寔。\n野味散芳芬，海殽参茂密。\n胸篆飞瑞烟，蠙珠媚炎日。\n掩嫮笼白鹇，盐章闷鸂鶒。\n归化服维新，皇朝重玄[质]（盾）。\n筮辰贡龙颜，表子躬逢地吉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈元光","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52522.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52522","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}